    "setup": "Set perflab.downstream.timeout-ms to 1000ms. Configure httpbin to respond in ~600ms. Drive /api/downstream at 50 users. Requests complete but slowly: each Tomcat thread blocks for 600ms per request. Thread utilisation is elevated, p99 is dominated by the external wait, and local DB metrics look healthy (DB is never reached on this path).\n",
